{
  "key": 21543,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_0349_R12R0101_00000",
      "en_US": [
        "I’m the Fishing Guru’s younger brother.\r",
        "You seem to like fishing.\n",
        "Am I right, or am I right?\f",
        "People say I have keen eyes!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0349_R12R0101_00001",
      "en_US": [
        "Yes, yes. Just as I thought!\r",
        "Here, fishing fan!\n",
        "Take this--it’s a Super Rod.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0349_R12R0101_00002",
      "en_US": [
        "Try your hand at fishing wherever there\n",
        "is water.\r",
        "Remember--you can catch different\n",
        "Pokémon depending on which Rod you use."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0349_R12R0101_00003",
      "en_US": [
        "Huh?\n",
        "My own eyes deceived me?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0349_R12R0101_00004",
      "en_US": [
        "Professor Oak: Oh! {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}! I see\n",
        "you’ve found my secret retreat.\r",
        "I used to like living in the depths\n",
        "of a valley, but I’ve grown quite used\f",
        "to the seaside in recent years!\r",
        "Regardless! I’d like to gift you with\n",
        "some Pokémon I give to trainers\f",
        "starting in the Kanto region.\r",
        "But first, I’d like you to show me\n",
        "a Kanto starter of your own!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0349_R12R0101_00005",
      "en_US": [
        "The Pokémon behind you isn’t\n",
        "a Kanto starter, I’m afraid!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0349_R12R0101_00006",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh! That is certainly a {STRVAR_1 0, 1, 0}...\n",
        "I always was a fan of that Pokémon!\r",
        "Very well, here you go!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0349_R12R0101_00007",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} received {COLOR 2}Charmander{COLOR 0} and {COLOR 2}Squirtle{COLOR 0}\n",
        "from Professor Oak!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0349_R12R0101_00008",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} received {COLOR 2}Bulbasaur{COLOR 0} and {COLOR 2}Squirtle{COLOR 0}\n",
        "from Professor Oak!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0349_R12R0101_00009",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} received {COLOR 2}Bulbasaur{COLOR 0} and\n",
        "{COLOR 2}Charmander{COLOR 0} from Professor Oak!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0349_R12R0101_00010",
      "en_US": [
        "Professor Oak: I should probably\n",
        "return to my lab in Pallet Town!\r",
        "Until we meet again!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0349_R12R0101_00011",
      "en_US": [
        "You’re going to have to make room\n",
        "in your party, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
